#### EV-018
**Date**: 2024-11  
**Event Name**: Blast Mainnet Upgrade — "Blast v1.1" / Hard Fork untuk Performance & Fee Market  
**Event Type**: Technology  
**Event Type**: Launch  
**Description**: Blast meluncurkan upgrade protokol (hard fork) untuk meningkatkan throughput, mengoptimalkan fee market (EIP-1559 style), dan memperbaiki bug minor. Upgrade dikordinasikan via governance.  
**Participants**: Blast Foundation; Blast Core Team; Blast L2; Blast Bridge; Ethereum (L1 settlement)  
**Location**: Blast Mainnet  
**Status**: Completed  
**Immediate Result**: Block time lebih cepat; gas fee lebih stabil; kompatibilitas EVM diperbaiki; tidak ada downtime signifikan.  
**Sources**: https://blog.blast.io (HIGH) — *cek announcement Nov 2024*; https://github.com/blastL2 (HIGH) — *release notes di repo*

